From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Go7 port <go7-port@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] View: add Onyx's refreshScreen for e-ink apps

KOReader and other apps written for Onyx's firmware call the hidden
View.refreshScreen(mode) and refreshScreen(left, top, width, height,
mode) by reflection to flash the e-ink panel. Requests with the FULL
bit (32) or the GC16 waveform (2) go to a small system_server service,
eink_refresh, which writes 1 to the onyx-epd driver's ui_flash node.
Every other mode is ignored. The service type comes with the matching
system/sepolicy patch.
---
 core/java/android/view/EinkRefresh.java       | 46 +++++++++++++++++++
 core/java/android/view/IEinkRefresh.aidl      |  6 +++
 core/java/android/view/View.java              | 12 +++++
 .../server/eink/EinkRefreshService.java       | 43 +++++++++++++++++
 .../java/com/android/server/SystemServer.java |  5 ++
 5 files changed, 112 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 core/java/android/view/EinkRefresh.java
 create mode 100644 core/java/android/view/IEinkRefresh.aidl
